        "message": "docs: refresh README with verified content, diagram, and dependency docs\n\n- Replace the badge row: License plus a real, live-verified Contributors badge\n  (the package is not yet published to npm, so no package-version badge is shown).\n- Add a real, module-grouped API Reference table mirroring reference.aspose.org's\n  own class index, plus a curated capability walkthrough.\n- Add a Mermaid \"At a Glance\" capability diagram (Starting Points -> Core\n  Capabilities -> Outputs), sourced from real, verified format support.\n- Add a \"## Dependencies\" section listing every real runtime dependency (name,\n  version constraint, and purpose) parsed directly from package.json.\n- Rewrite Key Capabilities, Scope and Limitations, Installation, Quick Start, and\n  Development and Testing sections against the real, current source -- every\n  factual claim independently verified, not carried over from the prior text.\n- Remove a stale claim that has since been resolved and would otherwise conflict\n  with the real, current repository state.\n\nVerification: every code example checked against the real TypeScript source;\nevery named class/member checked against the real reference index and source;\nevery dependency listed cross-checked against the real package.json.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
